          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- **Ramanujan's sum**: `Σ_{a<q, (a,q)=1} e(an/q) = Σ_{d∣q} μ(d) (q/d) [q/d ∣ n]`. -/\ntheorem ramanujan_sum (q n : ℕ) (hq : 1 ≤ q) :\n    ∑ a ∈ (range q).filter q.Coprime, e (a * n / q) =\n      ∑ d ∈ q.divisors, (μ d : ℂ) * (if q / d ∣ n then ((q / d : ℕ) : ℂ) else 0) := by",
